+# Terms of use — pre-release repository version
+
+All-In-One Fitness is a fitness logging and organization tool. It does not provide medical diagnosis, emergency services, or a guarantee that a suggested target or logged value is appropriate for a particular person.
+
+Users are responsible for the accuracy of information they enter, safeguarding account credentials, and using training or nutrition information within their own capabilities. The software is provided subject to applicable law and the final production terms that will identify the operating entity, governing law, warranty/liability terms, acceptable use, and contact process.
+
+Before public launch, publish reviewed production terms at a stable URL and update store metadata and in-app/support references to that canonical version.
